     with its own sizes (owner 2026-10-23): the Damian Shirt, graded from its CarbonGradingAI
     measurements into even steps, S–XXL. Four customer measurements
     only; the source spreadsheet's factory points are deliberately absent. -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
